 "_emptied_2026_09_23": "EndCard.lines AND Notification.notifications ARE NOW EMPTY, and empty is the ruling that already existed. Baked content is a LITERAL — it is dropped from `properties`, so propertyOverrides cannot reach it and EVERY placement draws it verbatim. EndCard baked '@promptly' and 'promptly.video': our handle on a customer's video with no property to change it. Notification baked 'Payment Received' / '$249.00 from Kellan': a fabricated financial record naming a person, rendered as if real. Same family as the six placeholder strings that became empty roots on 2026-09-22 — 'RENDERS NOTHING, NOT A PLACEHOLDER', because a component's internal state is not the viewer's content. Both components GUARD empty (EndCard `lines.length ?`, Notification `if (items.length === 0) return null`), so this draws nothing rather than throwing. If either should be placeable, its copy is a ruling, not a default."
}